{"sourceUrl":"https://cse.seu.edu.cn/2025/0702/c49475a534815/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:17.424173+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://cse.seu.edu.cn/2025/0702/c49475a534815/page.htm","html":"<div><p><br/></p><p><span><span>根据学校</span>2025<span>年全国优秀大学生夏令营活动工作部署，制订本学院具体工作方案并通知如下。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>一、学院概况</span></strong></p><p><span><span>东南大学计算机学科起源于</span>1960<span>年建立的</span></span><span>“</span><span>解算装置及技术</span><span>”</span><span><span>专业。</span>1960<span>年开始招收本科生，</span><span>1979</span><span>年开始招收硕士研究生，</span><span>1990</span><span>年开始招收博士研究生。</span><span>1981</span><span>年成立计算机科学与工程系，</span><span>2006</span><span>年成立计算机科学与工程学院。</span><span>2001</span><span>年成立软件学院，是我国首批</span><span>35</span><span>所</span></span><span>“</span><span>国家示范性软件学院</span><span>”</span><span><span>之一。</span>2018<span>年成立人工智能学院，是我国首批获得人工智能专业建设资格的</span><span>35</span><span>所高校之一。学院现有</span></span><span>“</span><span>计算机科学与技术</span><span>”</span><span>、</span><span>“</span><span>软件工程</span><span>”</span><span>、</span><span>“</span><span>智能科学与技术</span><span>”</span><span>三个一级学科博士学位授权点。</span><span>“</span><span>计算机科学与技术</span><span>”</span><span>一级学科为国家</span><span>“</span><span>双一流</span><span>”</span><span>建设学科，</span><span>“</span><span>软件工程</span><span>”</span><span><span>一级学科入选江苏省优势学科。</span>2024<span>年</span><span>3</span><span>月，</span></span><span>“</span><span>计算机科学</span><span>”</span><span>ESI<span>学科排名首次进入全球万分之一。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>二、申请条件</span></strong></p><p><span>拥护中国共产党的领导、愿为祖国建设服务、品德良好、遵纪守法的中国公民，且满足以下条件：</span></p><p><span>1.<span>在本科学校可取得推荐免试研究生资格</span></span></p><p><span>2.<span>研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力</span></span></p><p><span>3.<span>诚实守信，学风端正，无有违学术道德等行为</span></span></p><p><span>4.<span>身心健康</span></span></p><p><span>5.<span>英语水平良好</span></span></p><p><span>6.<span>学院其他要求：<strong>外校学生</strong>需获得一位东南大学计算机科学与工程学院、软件学院研究生导师推荐。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>三、申请者报名</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>1.<span>系统报名要求</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>（</span>1<span>）登录东南大学研究生报考服务系统（</span></span><a href=\"http://gsas.seu.edu.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>http://gsas.seu.edu.cn</span></a><span>，以下简称</span><span>“</span><span>系统</span><span>”</span><span><span>），选择</span><a href=\"https://cse.seu.edu.cn/2025/0702/c49475a534815/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a></span><span>“</span><span><span>全国优秀大</span><a href=\"https://cse.seu.edu.cn/2025/0702/c49475a534815/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>学生夏令营</span></span><span>”</span><span>项目。</span></p><p><span><span>（</span>2<span>）报名时间：</span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span></span><span>2</span><span>日</span><span>17</span><span>:00—8<span>月</span>1<span>日</span>24:00</span></p><p><span><span>（</span>3<span>）申请者只能申请一个志愿，</span></span><strong><span>请务必慎重选择</span></strong><span>，如实填写各项信息，信息填写完毕后认真核对，提交后将无法再做更改。</span></p><p><strong><span>2.<span>提交材料要求</span></span></strong></p><p><span>申请者在系统中报名时，须线上提交以下材料，且须保证所提交材料的真实性和准确性，若弄虚作假，一经发现，取消申请资格。</span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><strong><span>材料清单</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>要求</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>1.<span>东南大学全国优秀大学生夏令营活动申请表</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>1.<span>系统生成表格，下载打印后交学校教务部门或院系签章，同时本人手写签名，再电子版上传；</span></span></p><p><span>2.<span>如已有学校教务部门或院系盖章的成绩排名证明，申请表中学校教务部门或院系签章可免，须将成绩排名证明一并上传。</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>2.<span>有效身份证明</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>二代居民身份证，正反面</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>3.<span>在学证明</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>完整注册的学生证或有效期内的《教育部学籍信息在线验证报告》</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>4.<span>现有本科阶段成绩单</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>学校教务部门或学院盖章</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>5.<span>外语成绩证明</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><a href=\"https://cse.seu.edu.cn/2025/0702/c49475a534815/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a>CET-4<span>、</span><span>CET-6</span><span>、</span><span>TOEFL</span><span>、</span><span>IELTS</span><span>等证书或成绩单</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>6.<span>学术成果证明</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>论文、专利、学科竞赛证书等</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>7.<span>奖励情况证明</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>校级以上（含）荣誉奖励证书</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>8.<span>实践经历证明</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>科研训练、实习实践、社会工作等相关证明</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>9.<span>其他</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>具体要求见系统说明</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong><span>上传材料请端正扫描，并去掉各种背景颜色</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>3.<span>导师推荐系统</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>导师推荐系统相关说明预计</span>8<span>月</span></span><span>8</span><span>日左右在此处更新，请及时关注。</span></p><p><span><strong>外校学生<span>（含报考苏州联合研究生院计算机技术/人工智能专业的学生）</span></strong><span>需获得一位东南大学计算机科学与工程学院、软件学院研究生导师推荐，并通过以下<span>推荐系统(非<span>东南大学研究生报考服务系统</span>)</span>进行确认。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>推荐系统</span>开放时间：2025年8月9日9:00-2025年8月12日24:00</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>推荐</span>系统登录及操作说明：【<span>夏令营导师推荐双选功能操作手册（学生端）</span>】</span><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cse.seu.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_pdf.gif\"/><a href=\"https://cse.seu.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/04/51/1eb7e8ad42f88bef627fc2e913f8/9d42ae7a-3940-4212-96ab-2baaaba998d3.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"夏令营导师推荐双选功能操作手册（学生端）.pdf\">夏令营导师推荐双选功能操作手册（学生端）.pdf</a></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span>四、审核与确认</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>1.<span>学院审核</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>报名结束后，学院将从已提交报名信息的申请者中择优筛选</span>,<span>届时将通过学院官网（</span>https://cs.seu.edu.cn</span><span>）</span><span>公布入选名单。</span><strong><span>请申请者及时关注学院官网发布的入选名单，以免错失机会。未入选者不再另行通知。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>2.<span>入选者确认</span></span></strong></p><p><a href=\"https://cse.seu.edu.cn/2025/0702/c49475a534815/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><a href=\"https://cse.seu.edu.cn/2025/0702/c49475a534815/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>公布入选名单两天内，学院将通过</span></span><a href=\"http://121.248.63.139/zsgl/tmsgl/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>系统</span></a><span>发布具体工作安排，入选者须及时在系统中回复</span><span>“</span><span>确认参加</span><span>”</span><span>或</span><span>“</span><span><span>确认不参加</span><a href=\"https://cse.seu.edu.cn/2025/0702/c49475a534815/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a></span><span>”</span><span><span>，未在规定时间内回复者，将视为自动放弃。</span><a href=\"https://cse.seu.edu.cn/2025/0702/c49475a534815/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a></span><strong><span><a href=\"https://cse.seu.edu.cn/2025/0702/c49475a534815/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>请入选者及时关注系统中的夏令营工作安排，以免错失机会。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span>五、其他说明</span></strong></p><p><span>1.<span>本</span></span><span>校</span><span>应届本科生</span><span>申请者</span><span>必须报名参加夏令营。</span></p><p><span>2.<span>本校应届本科生拟报名工程硕博士专项、集成电路专项班、国优计划、支教团计划、辅导员计划等推免专项的，须报名参加夏令营（拟跨学院读研的，须报名拟读研学院的夏令营）。</span></span></p><p><span>3.<span>苏州联合研究生院计算机技术</span>/<span>人工智能专业的学生由我院负责培养，参加我院统一组织的夏令营。有意报名的申请者，请关注苏州联合研究生院发布的夏令营报名通知。</span></span></p><p><span>4.<span>雷恩研究生学院计算机技术专业的学生由我院负责培养，有意报名雷恩研究生学院计算机技术专业的申请者，请关注雷恩研究生学院发布的相关通知。</span></span></p><p><span>5</span><span>.<span>如遇政策调整，以相关政策规定为准。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>六、咨询方式</span></strong></p><p><span>报名</span><span>“</span><strong><span>计算机科学与工程学院</span></strong><span>”</span><span>，请联系：邢老师</span></p><p><span><span>电话：</span>025-52090862<span>邮箱：</span>csejisuanji@126.com</span></p><p><span>报名</span><span>“</span><strong><span>软件学院</span></strong><span>”</span><span>，请联系：李老师</span></p><p><span><span>电话：</span>025-52090976 <span>邮箱：</span><span>rjyjszs@126.com</span></span></p><p><span>报名</span><span>“</span><strong><span><span>东南大学</span>-<span>蒙纳什苏州联合研究生院</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>计算机技术</span>/<span>人工智能专业</span></span></strong><span>”</span><span>，请联系：蔡老师</span></p><p><span><span>电话：</span>025-52090983 <span>邮箱：</span><span>396156793@qq.com</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span>咨询时间：周一至周五，上午</span>9:30-11:30<span>，下午</span><span>14:00-17:00</span><span>。暑假期间（</span><span>7</span><span>月</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>日至</span>8<span>月</span><span>1</span></span><span>9</span><span>日），请邮箱咨询。</span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"863207789548f6d8af9ea95904f3b407e000c6e709364f8635ec3a3bc5890112","textLength":2084,"sourceSha256":"51b58f395a0e0444cebdca8ee4b606d3aec29110dfd92110a7532811f4a1b0ef","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-a2d257ee572539da2a5f","title":"2025年东南大学计算机科学与工程学院、软件学院2025年全国优秀大学生夏令营活动报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:17.424173+00:00"}
